menu "M5Stack Tab5"

config GBX_TAB5_X3_LAYOUT
    bool "UI layout with a 3x game window"
    default n
    select GBX_DISPLAY_LOCK_GAME_DRAW
    help
        The asset pack is built from assets/ui/m5stack_tab5_x3, whose
        720x480 game window is as wide as the screen and shows GBA frames
        at 3x. Without it the pack takes assets/ui/m5stack_tab5, with a
        480x320 window at 2x. See docs/ui-layouts/index.md.

        With this layout the DSI panel underran, and the picture flashed,
        so the present task holds the LVGL lock while it draws a game
        frame, see GBX_DISPLAY_LOCK_GAME_DRAW.

endmenu
